  "col_right L8: «Varāhamihira» and «Jātaka» have the bars over the a; the hyphen of «Laghu-Jātaka» is printed as a point at mid height; read as a hyphen.",
  "col_right L9: «Pañcasiddhāntikā» has the tilde on the n and the bars over the second and the last a; specks before «et» and before «1» are not transcribed.",
