  "col_right L39: «Οὐάλης» is Greek, read at 8,000 dpi: the υ carries the smooth breathing and the α the acute. «Wālīs» has the bars over the a and the i (the bar over the i 2.4 by 1.1 points, flatter than the round dots of the i's of «unde», «Veles» and «Vettius»), measured at 2,400 dpi and read at 8,000 dpi.",
  "col_right L40: the footnote reference «(1)» is printed in the type of the text, on the line.",
